  "text": "Bilkul 😊 Agar **shaadi ke liye budget mein online saree** chahiye, toh main ₹500–₹2,000 range mein **Banarasi, Kanjivaram-look aur silk-blend** sarees ko prefer karunga. Current listings mein is range mein kaafi options mil rahe hain. [www.flipkart.com](https://www.flipkart.com/q/bridal-banarasi-sarees?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n### [SIRIL Kanjivaram Silk Saree]()\n*₹569*\n\n### [Glory Banarasi Satin Kanjivaram Saree]()\n*₹899*\n\n### [SGF11 Kanjivaram Soft Saree]()\n*₹949*\n\n### [Sidhidata Kanjivaram Banarasi Saree]()\n*₹649*\n\n### [JS Clothing Mart Georgette Stone Work Saree]()\n*₹460*\n\n### [SWORNOF Kanjivaram Silk Saree]()\n*₹929*\n\n### 💃 Shaadi ke function ke hisaab se meri picks\n\n- **Bride ki close relative / sister:** Red, maroon ya wine **Banarasi/Kanjivaram-look** — ₹800–₹1,500.\n- **Reception:** Dark blue, emerald green ya magenta **zari Banarasi** — bahut rich dikhegi.\n- **Haldi/Mehendi:** Yellow, mustard, green ya pink **lightweight silk-blend** — ₹500–₹1,000.\n- **Day wedding:** Peach, pink, lavender ya pastel Kanjivaram-look.\n- **Very tight budget:** ₹500–₹800 mein bhi achhe-looking options mil rahe hain; lekin is price par listing mein \"pure silk\" likha ho toh fabric details/reviews zaroor check karna. [mysilklove.com](https://mysilklove.com/collections/banarasi-sarees-under-3000?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nAgar **₹1,000 ke andar** chahiye, toh Sudathi par bhi wedding collection mein Banarasi/Kanjivaram-style sarees ₹799–₹999 ke aas-paas listed hain. [sudathi.com](https://sudathi.com/collections/wedding?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n**Meri personal choice:** ₹800–₹1,500 ka **maroon/wine Banarasi with gold zari + matching blouse** — budget mein bhi shaadi wala rich look deta hai. ❤️",
